msgstr "Advanced functions"
msgid "home.advanced.slogan"
msgstr "Use all the features we offer"
msgid "home.advanced.description"
msgstr "Dulno has a wide range of functions to help you with the automation process."
msgid "home.advanced.account.headline"
msgstr "Accounts"
msgid "home.advanced.account.description"
msgstr "Use the account overview to view and delete existing accounts and link new ones"
msgid "home.advanced.timeline.headline"
msgstr "Workflow timeline"
msgid "home.advanced.timeline.description"
msgstr "Use the workflow timeline to monitor the execution, changes and errors that have occurred in the workflows"
msgid "home.advanced.condition.headline"
msgstr "Conditions"
msgid "home.advanced.condition.description"
msgstr "Control the flow of workflows by simply adding conditions for further execution"
msgid "home.advanced.webhook.headline"
msgstr "Webhooks"
msgid "home.advanced.webhook.description"
msgstr "Workflows can be triggered by webhooks or external webhooks can be called by workflows"
msgid "home.advanced.database.headline"
msgstr "Databases"
msgid "home.advanced.database.description"
msgstr "In many use cases, it can be practical to save data for or through workflows. We offer the database feature for this purpose"
msgid "home.advanced.template.headline"
msgstr "Templates"
msgid "home.advanced.template.description"
msgstr "There are already many templates that you can use as inspiration for your use cases"
msgid "home.download.headline"
msgstr "Download"
msgid "home.download.slogan"
msgstr "Download the Dulno app now"
msgid "home.download.description"
msgstr "The Dulno app is available in both the Google Play Store and the Apple Store"

